id=maxregner
name=Maxregner System
version=2.1.1
versionCode=23
author=maxregner
description=Maxregner navigation (Maxregner Orb), sound scheme, full UI design system recode, extras, performance and security profiles. Ships compiled RRO overlay APKs that Magisk mounts systemlessly over the read-only erofs partitions, plus runtime props (resetprop) and real sound assets. System-wide: framework widget style + drawable overrides (checkbox/radio/seekbar/progress/button/spinner/edittext) and framework icon overrides (stat_sys_*, ic_*). Safe by design: only custom-namespace props at boot (no system prop overrides), no layout/class swaps, no base Theme.DeviceDefault/Material overrides (those hang boot via windowBackground), no init rc sysfs writes, no font/config.xml replacements.
